     "object": "a_gemarei_iakar",
     "gloss_en": "רבי אסי גמריה איעקר ליה, ואתא רבי אלעזר לאדכוריה -- R' Asi's learning had been uprooted, and R' Elazar came to remind him (= p_relazar_lema_li_acher)",
