    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_relazar_lema_li_acher",
     "gloss_en": "why do I need another half olive-bulk? let the master say it of the same one, from which two things are learned: that it is not digestion, and that his throat has had benefit of an olive-bulk"
